From: openRuyi Project Contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Avoid redundant newline in legal output

The legal text already carries its own line endings. fmt.Println adds an
additional newline and is rejected by Go vet; fmt.Print preserves the output.

---
 cmd/misspell/main.go | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/cmd/misspell/main.go b/cmd/misspell/main.go
--- a/cmd/misspell/main.go
+++ b/cmd/misspell/main.go
@@ -122,5 +122,5 @@
 	}
 	if *showLegal {
-		fmt.Println(misspell.Legal)
+		fmt.Print(misspell.Legal)
 		return
 	}
